@ 1:5  tree|map
  1:1-1:8 "treemap"
  | **`treemap`**
  |
  | `treemap` or `treemap-beta`: starts a treemap.
@ 2:5  ti|tle Budget
  2:3-2:8 "title"
  | **`title`**
  |
  | `title Budget`: the title drawn above the treemap (the last one wins).
@ 3:8  accTi|tle: Household
  3:3-3:11 "accTitle"
  | **`accTitle`**
  |
  | `accTitle: …`: the accessible title.
@ 4:6  acc|Descr: Spending
  4:3-4:11 "accDescr"
  | **`accDescr`**
  |
  | `accDescr: …` or `accDescr { … }`: the accessible description.
@ 5:7  "A":|::hot
  5:6-5:9 ":::"
  | **`:::`**
  |
  | `:::name`: the class of a row, right after its name or value.
@ 6:8  class|Def hot fill:red
  6:3-6:11 "classDef"
  | **`classDef`**
  |
  | `classDef name styles;`: a class of styles that rows take with `:::name`; a repeat adds styles.
